":9},{"text":"일반","x":208,"y":814,"width":56,"height":31},{"text":"트리외는","x":273,"y":814,"width":115,"height":32},{"text":"달리","x":397,"y":813,"width":53,"height":32},{"text":"이진","x":464,"y":814,"width":52,"height":31},{"text":"트리는","x":527,"y":814,"width":81,"height":33},{"text":"노드를","x":616,"y":816,"width":80,"height":31},{"text":"하나도","x":705,"y":815,"width":80,"height":33},{"text":"갖지","x":795,"y":813,"width":49,"height":34},{"text":"않을","x":857,"y":814,"width":53,"height":33},{"text":"수도","x":918,"y":814,"width":54,"height":32},{"text":"있다.","x":983,"y":815,"width":58,"height":32}]},{"text":"• 서브 트리간에 순서가 존재한다는 점도 다른 점이다. 따라서 왼쪽 서브트리와 오른쪽 서브트","words":[{"text":"•","x":181,"y":880,"width":8,"height":8},{"text":"서브","x":207,"y":868,"width":57,"height":32},{"text":"트리간에","x":276,"y":868,"width":111,"height":32},{"text":"순서가","x":400,"y":868,"width":85,"height":33},{"text":"존재한다는","x":494,"y":869,"width":136,"height":33},{"text":"점도","x":642,"y":870,"width":52,"height":32},{"text":"다른","x":705,"y":870,"width":53,"height":33},{"text":"점이다.","x":769,"y":869,"width":85,"height":33},{"text":"따라서","x":869,"y":869,"width":76,"height":33},{"text":"왼쪽","x":960,"y":869,"width":53,"height":33},{"text":"서브트리와","x":1024,"y":870,"width":137,"height":33},{"text":"오른쪽","x":1171,"y":870,"width":83,"height":31},{"text":"서브트","x":1264,"y":868,"width":83,"height":32}]},{"text":"리를 구별한다.","words":[{"text":"리를","x":209,"y":923,"width":55,"height":31},{"text":"구별한다.","x":274,"y":922,"width":120,"height":33}]},{"text":"b","words":[{"text":"b","x":309,"y":1236,"width":14,"height":22}]},{"text":"C","words":[{"text":"C","x":402,"y":1242,"width":13,"height":16}]},{"text":"[그림 8-9] 이진트리의 예","words":[{"text":"[그림","x":175,"y":1468,"width":53,"height":28},{"text":"8-9]","x":239,"y":1469,"width":52,"height":29},{"text":"이진트리의","x":309,"y":1472,"width":108,"height":24},{"text":"예","x":427,"y":1472,"width":19,"height":23}]},{"text":"이진트리의 예로서 [그림 8-9]에 수식을 표현하는 이진트리를 나타내었다. 수식에서 각 연산자","words":[{"text":"이진트리의","x":208,"y":1576,"width":136,"height":31},{"text":"예로서","x":357,"y":1576,"width":78,"height":31},{"text":"[그림","x":449,"y":1576,"width":53,"height":29},{"text":"8-9]에","x":513,"y":1576,"width":77,"height":31},{"text":"수식을","x":602,"y":1576,"width":79,"height":31},{"text":"표현하는","x":690,"y":1576,"width":105,"height":30},{"text":"이진트리를","x":804,"y":1576,"width":132,"height":31},{"text":"나타내었다.","x":946,"y":1576,"width":140,"height":32},{"text":"수식에서","x":1098,"y":1576,"width":106,"height":32},{"text":"각","x":1217,"y":1576,"width":28,"height":30},{"text":"연산자","x":1254,"y":1576,"width":81,"height":30}]},{"text":"들은 하나 또는 2개의 피연산자를 가지고 있다. 왼쪽 피연산지는 왼쪽 서브트리가 되고 오른쪽","words":[{"text":"들은","x":180,"y":1629,"width":52,"height":29},{"text":"하나","x":243,"y":1629,"width":57,"height":30},{"text":"또는","x":311,"y":1630,"width":56,"height":28},{"text":"2개의","x":379,"y":1629,"width":67,"height":30},{"text":"피연산자를","x":461,"y":1629,"width":133,"height":30},{"text":"가지고","x":606,"y":1628,"width":78,"height":31},{"text":"있다.","x":697,"y":1629,"width":55,"height":30},{"text":"왼쪽","x":768,"y":1629,"width":53,"height":30},{"text":"피연산지는","x":832,"y":1629,"width":134,"height":30},{"text":"왼쪽","x":977,"y":1629,"width":53,"height":31},{"text":"서브트리가","x":1041,"y":1629,"width":136,"height":31},{"text":"되고","x":1188,"y":1629,"width":52,"height":30},{"text":"오른쪽","x":1252,"y":1630,"width":82,"height":28}]},{"text":"피 연산자는 오른쪽 서브트리로 표현된다. 단말도-드는 상수이거나 변수이다.","words":[{"text":"피","x":178,"y":1681,"width":22,"height":31},{"text":"연산자는","x":206,"y":1681,"width":110,"height":31},{"text":"오른쪽","x":324,"y":1683,"width":84,"height":28},{"text":"서브트리로","x":418,"y":1680,"width":134,"height":32},{"text":"표현된다.","x":561,"y":1680,"width":111,"height":31},{"text":"단말도-드는","x":684,"y":1680,"width":132,"height":30},{"text":"상수이거나","x":824,"y":1681,"width":134,"height":31},{"text":"변수이다.","x":968,"y":1682,"width":111,"height":30}]},{"text":"이진트리의 성질","words":[{"text":"이진트리의","x":179,"y":1822,"width":171,"height":38},{"text":"성질","x":364,"y":1821,"width":67,"height":38}]},{"text":"• ,z개의 노드를 가진 이진트리는 정확하게 ,t-1의 간선을 가진다. 그 이유는 이진트리에서의","words":[{"text":"•","x":186,"y":1901,"width":9,"height":8},{"text":",z개의","x":211,"y":1890,"width":72,"height":30},{"text":"노드를","x":298,"y":1891,"width":84,"height":28},{"text":"가진","x":393,"y":1889,"width":55,"height":30},{"text":"이진트리는","x":461,"y":1889,"width":133,"height":30},{"text":"정확하게","x":605,"y":1889,"width":102,"height":31},{"text":",t-1의","x":721,"y":1888,"width":85,"height":30},{"text":"간선을","x":820,"y":1888,"width":79,"height":30},{"text":"가진다.","x":910,"y":1889,"width":85,"height":30},{"text":"그","x":1010,"y":1893,"width":28,"height":21},{"text":"이유는","x":1050,"y":1889,"width":81,"height":30},{"text":"이진트리에서의","x":1143,"y":1890,"width":185,"height":30}]},{"text":"노드는 루트를 제외하면 정확하게 하나의 부모-노드를 가진다. 그리고 부모와 자식 간에는 정","words":[{"text":"노드는","x":209,"y":1943,"width":87,"height":27},{"text":"루트를","x":306,"y":1942,"width":84,"height":30},{"text":"제외하면","x":401,"y":1941,"width":108,"height":30},{"text":"정확하게","x":521,"y":1941,"width":102,"height":30},{"text":"하나의","x":636,"y":1941,"width":76,"height":30},{"text":"부모-노드를","x":724,"y":1940,"width":131,"height":31},{"text":"가진다.","x":865,"y":1939,"width":84,"height":31},{"text":"그리고","x":963,"y":1940,"width":81,"height":30},{"text":"부모와","x":1054,"y":1941,"width":82,"height":29},{"text":"자식","x":1146,"y":1941,"width":52,"height":30},{"text":"간에는","x":1212,"y":1941,"width":81,"height":30},{"text":"정","x":1305,"y":1941,"width":22,"height":30}]},{"text":"확하게 하나의 간선만이 존재한다. 따라서 간선의 개수는 ,t-1이다. [그림 8-1이을 참조하라.","words":[{"text":"확하게","x":210,"y":1993,"width":82,"height":30},{"text":"하나의","x":304,"y":1992,"width":81,"height":31},{"text":"간선만이","x":397,"y":1992,"width":106,"height":30},{"text":"존재한다.","x":515,"y":1992,"width":112,"height":30},{"text":"따라서","x":640,"y":1992,"width":74,"height":31},{"text":"간선의","x":727,"y":1991,"width":74,"height":31},{"text":"개수는","x":814,"y"